swift-nio-ssl on Windows: apple/swift-nio-ssl#567, "Add support for Windows", by Joannis, as of
its commit 22c1c18, without its changes to .github, which are swift-nio-ssl's own CI.
https://github.com/apple/swift-nio-ssl/pull/567

No swift-nio-ssl release supports Windows yet. The pull request starts from 8d8f784 on main,
which 2.37.5 has, and applies to it unchanged. Open upstream, not released yet.

